# An inner counter the outer loop does not reset: the store writes 32
# words, 128 B (ptxas unrolls it to 32 stores at param_0 + 0 to 124), its
# base 16 B further on each outer trip. The inner counter starts from the
# outer loop's φ, which is no recurrence until exit values, so the
# address is unknown.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/carried_counter.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
CHECK: kernel micro_carried_counter
CHECK: st.global.u32  global store 4 B    unknown: depends on %r1, carried around an enclosing loop
